		{
			description: [
				"&5&lDraconic Evolution.&r Found in a &eChaos Island&r - a floating obsidian ring far out in the End, thousands of blocks from the main island."
				""
				"&e&lNo summoning.&r Fly out and find one. Use the End dimension map or just pick a direction and commit."
				""
				"&c&lBring:&r full Draconic or Wyvern armour, an elytra, and a way home. It flies, it shoots chaos bolts, and the crystals around the arena heal it - break those first."
				""
				"&e&lDrops &7Chaos Shards&r - the root of every awakened Draconic item. Nothing above Wyvern tier exists without this fight."
			]
