		{
			description: [
				"&d&lBotania.&r This one you summon, and the setup is the whole difficulty."
				""
				"&e&lYou need:&r a &fBeacon&r with a full base, ringed by &fGaia Pylons&r, then throw a &fGaia Ingot&r onto the beacon."
				""
				"&7The arena must be a 21x21 clear space or it refuses to spawn. It teleports constantly and summons copies of you.&r"
				""
				"&e&lDrops &7Dice of Fate&r and &7Life Essence&r - Life Essence is required for the strongest Botania relics."
			]
			icon: "botania:life_essence"
