		{
			description: [
				"&a&lArs Nouveau.&r Summoned with the &fRitual of the Wilden&r."
				""
				"&e&lYou need:&r a Ritual Brazier, the Wilden ritual tablet, and one each of &fWilden Wing&r, &fWilden Horn&r and &fWilden Spike&r - all dropped by ordinary Wilden mobs."
				""
				"&7It changes phase mid-fight: flying, charging, then summoning. Each phase is immune to something different, so bring more than one damage type.&r"
				""
				"&e&lDrops &7Chimera loot&r used in the highest-tier Ars armour and the Enchanter's Sword."
			]
