				"&3&lCataclysm.&r A sunken warship boss in deep ocean biomes."
				""
				"&e&lYou need:&r the &fMechanical Ignition&r, crafted from parts found in the Sunken City. Use it on the ship to wake it."
				""
				"&c&lIt is invincible outside water&r - the game will tell you so. You have to fight it in its element, so bring Respiration, Depth Strider and a way to breathe."
